{"meta":{"id":"tt34610311","type":"movie","name":"Operación Sombra","imdb_id":"tt34610311","description":"Unos astutos y traicioneros ladrones desafian a la Policía Judicial de Macao. La Policía, que se encontraba en una dura batalla, invita de nuevo al experto en rastreo Huang De Zhong, retirado desde hace muchos años, a unir fuerzas con la joven élite del Departamento de Investigación Criminal de la Policía Judicial. Bajo la colisión de las técnicas tradicionales de rastreo y la alta tecnología, la policía y los criminales luchan con ingenio y valentía, y se lanzan a un duelo entre el bien y el mal parecido al juego del gato y el ratón.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt34610311.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4BtL2vvEufDXDP4u6xQjjQ1Y2aT.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ydk33NEl57XqGSc0Bo6phCoYkGG.png","genres":["Acción","Crimen","Drama","Suspense"],"releaseInfo":"2025","released":"2025-08-16T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"142 min","imdbRating":"7.0","country":"China, Hong Kong","cast":["Jackie Chan","张子枫","梁家輝","此沙","Jun","周政杰","王杍逸","郎月婷","林秋楠","王振威","李哲坤","黃錦燊","刘俊孝","马灿灿","黃愷傑","芦芳生","马兆壮","惠园","蔡鹭","侯佳伟","焦阳","朱新辉","汤畅","旭康","泰乐","谷智鑫","李达","杨晴天","于荣光","向泽恩"],"director":["杨子"],"writer":["杨子"],"trailers":[{"source":"HZXVnn6GnVM","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer [Subtitled]","ytId":"HZXVnn6GnVM","lang":"en"},{"source":"xvmADAJOoCg","type":"Trailer","name":"UK Trailer [Subtitled]","ytId":"xvmADAJOoCg","lang":"en"},{"source":"dDuzTlur3NU","type":"Trailer","name":"International Trailer [CN/ENG SUB]","ytId":"dDuzTlur3NU","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"HZXVnn6GnVM","title":"Official Trailer [Subtitled]"},{"ytId":"xvmADAJOoCg","title":"UK Trailer [Subtitled]"},{"ytId":"dDuzTlur3NU","title":"International Trailer [CN/ENG SUB]"}],"links":[{"name":"7.0","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt34610311"},{"name":"Acción","category":"Genres